| Section | Content |
|--------|---------|
| **Purpose** | WCAG AA metrics rule; samples `p, a, button, h1–h3, li`; thresholds **4.5:1** (&lt;24px) and **3:1** (≥24px); Plan/Do/Check/Adjust tied to `forge-theme.css` tokens |
| **Passing signals** | Token-backed `forge-card` / `forge-support` / `btn btn-forge`; empty `metrics.contrastReport.lowContrast` |
