| **After example** | Same card using `breathe-static`, default token surfaces, no inline color overrides |
| **Evidence and remediation** | Evidence table + 5 remediation steps (tokens, harness, `patch-registry.mjs`) |
| **Related rules** | `DET.TOKEN.NO_DRIFT`, `DET.THEME.FONT_STACK`, `DET.SURFACE.ELEVATION_TOKEN`, `AI.THEME.PERSONALITY_COHERENCE`, `AI.AMBIENT.READABILITY_CONFLICT` |

