### Promote to the canonical path

The full page is in the blender workspace mirror; the repo-root handbook file is still the old bootstrap stub because writes outside the current workspace root were blocked.

From the Kitchen Sink repo root, run:

```bash
node tools/website-ux-auditor/design-rules/blender/_run-copy-det-theme-contrast-min.mjs
```

That copies  
`tools/website-ux-auditor/design-rules/blender/docs/design/ux-audit/rule-pages/det-theme-contrast-min.md` →  
`docs/design/ux-audit/rule-pages/det-theme-contrast-min.md`  
and verifies `page_version`.

Or:

```bash
cp tools/website-ux-auditor/design-rules/blender/docs/design/ux-audit/rule-pages/det-theme-contrast-min.md \
   docs/design/ux-audit/rule-pages/det-theme-contrast-min.md
```

After promotion, `grep "Theme contrast minimum" docs/design/ux-audit/rule-pages/det-theme-contrast-min.md` should match.

No changes were made to check modules, `rule-mappings.js`, or `registry.generated.json`.
